@startuml

hide footbox
title US0013 - To get official genres list

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":GenreController" as GenreController
participant ":GenreRepository" as GenreRepository

User -> UI : **1** getGenresList()

UI -> GenreController : **2** getGenresList()
activate GenreController

GenreController -> GenreRepository : **3** findAllGenres()
activate GenreRepository

GenreRepository --> GenreController : **4** List<Genre>
deactivate GenreRepository

GenreController --> UI : **5** List<Genre>
deactivate GenreController

UI --> User : **6** Official List of Genres



@enduml